cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Se utilizzi questo software, per favore citalo secondo i metadati
  seguenti (aggiorna il campo `preferred-citation` con il DOI del
  paper una volta reso pubblico/preregistrato).
type: software
title: Edge-of-Chaos
authors:
  - family-names: Iavarone
    given-names: Francesco
    affiliation: Independent Researcher
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-22"
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/matrixNeo76/Edge-of-Chaos"
abstract: >-
  Falsifiable research programme and digital-twin metrology platform
  (Python + Rust) testing the necessary physical conditions for primary
  interoceptive sentience in continuous neuromorphic substrates. Implements
  the thermodynamic/allostatic valence functional Psi(t) and the three
  operational demarcation tests (edge-of-chaos activity, spectral causal
  degeneracy, finite-size scaling) of the P0_Distilled v0.1 research
  programme.
keywords:
  - neuromorphic computing
  - memristors
  - edge of chaos
  - interoceptive sentience
  - consciousness research
  - thermodynamic valence
  - falsifiability
  - digital twin
  - Rust
  - Python
  - PyO3
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Necessary Conditions for Primary Interoceptive Sentience in Continuous
    Substrates: A Falsifiable Programme
  authors:
    - family-names: Iavarone
      given-names: Francesco
      affiliation: Independent Researcher
  year: 2026
  notes: >-
    Manoscritto v0.1, settembre 2026 (docs/P0_Distilled_v0.1.tex). Aggiornare
    con DOI/venue una volta disponibile una decisione editoriale o un DOI di
    preprint.
